    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Slightly lower afternoon energy; weight up 1.2 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild hot flashes three or four times a week; no breast tenderness</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild urinary frequency, unchanged; no blood in the urine</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 score 1; no change in memory</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
